# ---- registry sync tick (optional, BH-5650) ----
# bin/registry-sync.sh (cron */5, every box) does nothing unless
# REGISTRY_SOURCE=db. In db mode it re-renders and applies this box's crontab
# when the registry version changed since the last apply, and never otherwise.
# A failed render, a dropped live triage lane or a crontab(1) reject leaves the
# live crontab as it was and writes one ALERTS line per version; the next tick
# retries. Off via flags/lane-off-registry-sync.
# The checkout the crontab is rendered from (the root update-runners.sh uses).
#REGISTRY_SYNC_CHECKOUT=/root/harness-checkout
